// Auto-synced home of the snarkjs-generated Groth16 verifier contracts:
//   Groth16VerifierOwnership.sol / Groth16VerifierMortgage.sol / Groth16VerifierTransfer.sol
//
// They are produced by `pnpm --filter blockchain run circuits:setup` (which runs
// scripts/setup/syncVerifiers.ts; standalone re-sync: `verifiers:sync`) and are
// GITIGNORED: their verification-key constants must match the gitignored .zkey,
// which is regenerated with fresh entropy on every setup run — committing them
// would invite a silent proving-key/verifier mismatch.
//
// Hand-written contracts (LandRegistryVerifier.sol) never import these files —
// they depend on contracts/interfaces/IGroth16Verifiers.sol, so the project
// compiles on a fresh checkout before any trusted setup has been run.
